{"suttaId":"sn12.72-81","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-ii","vriCode":"s0302m.mul","paras":[573,589],"vripara":"72"},"segments":{"sn12.72-81:0.3":"2-11. Jātisuttādidasakaṃ","sn12.72-81:1.1":"Sāvatthiyaṃ viharati … pe … jātiṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:2.1":"(3) Bhavaṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:3.1":"(4) Upādānaṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:4.1":"(5) Taṇhaṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:5.1":"(6) Vedanaṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:6.1":"(7) Phassaṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:7.1":"(8) Saḷāyatanaṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:8.1":"(9) Nāmarūpaṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:9.1":"(10) Viññāṇaṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:10.1":"(11)“Saṅkhāre nappajānanti, saṅkhārasamudayaṃ nappajānanti, saṅkhāranirodhaṃ nappajānanti, saṅkhāranirodhagāminiṃ paṭipadaṃ nappajānanti … pe … saṅkhāre pajānanti … pe … sayaṃ abhiññā sacchikatvā upasampajja viharantī”ti.","sn12.72-81:10.4":"Ekādasamaṃ.","sn12.72-81:10.5":"Samaṇabrāhmaṇavaggo aṭṭhamo.","sn12.72-81:11.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","sn12.72-81:11.1":"Paccayekādasa vuttā, catusaccavibhajjanā;","sn12.72-81:11.3":"Samaṇabrāhmaṇavaggo, nidāne bhavati aṭṭhamo.","sn12.72-81:12.0":"Vagguddānaṃ –","sn12.72-81:12.1":"Buddho āhāro dasabalo, kaḷāro gahapatipañcamo;","sn12.72-81:12.3":"Dukkhavaggo mahāvaggo, aṭṭhamo samaṇabrāhmaṇoti."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
